{"title": "[新聞] OpenAI年化營收比先前透露的數字少200億", "author": "DrowningPool (My broken dreams)", "board": "", "date": "Fri Oct  9 01:01:59 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/Stock/M.1791478921.A.3F2.html", "body": "原文標題：\n\n請勿刪減或自創標題，違者4-1處分，此行請刪除\n\nOpenAI annualised revenues $20bn less than previously signalled\n\n原文連結：\n\n網址超過一行，請用縮網址，連結不能點擊者板規 1-2-2 處分\n。\n\nhttps://reurl.cc/NOgK5Q\n\n發布時間：\n\n請勿張貼超過3天新聞\n\n2026-10-9\n\n記者署名：\n\nGeorge Hammond and Stephen Morris\n\n原文內容：\n\nOpenAI’s annualised revenue is about $20bn less than has been previously\nsignalled, according to financial documents shared with investors, a massive\ngap likely to damp optimism about the growth of AI demand.\n\nThe company has recently told investors its revenues were approaching $50bn\non an annualised basis at the end of September, far short of the $70bn\nreported by the FT and other media outlets late last month based on\ninformation that was provided to investors.\n\nThe metric, along with the equivalent figure for OpenAI rival Anthropic, is\nthe most important indicator of overall demand for AI and underpins vast\ninfrastructure spending and the growth of public equity markets.\n\nAccording to a person with knowledge of the matter, the discrepancy arose\nfrom attempts by OpenAI’s own investors to produce a direct comparison with\nAnthropic’s annualised revenues. The pair calculate the figure in different\nways, with Anthropic including the revenue from sales via cloud partners such\nas AWS and Google Cloud, while OpenAI does not.\n\nEfforts to “gross up” OpenAI’s annualised revenue led to reports that the\ngroup’s annualised revenue had hit $40bn in August. The company has since\ntold investors its revenues have grown more than 70 per cent, leading to the\n$70bn figure.\n\n根據 OpenAI 向投資人提供的財務文件，該公司的\n。如此巨大的差距，可能削弱市場對人工智慧需求成長的樂觀預期。\nOpenAI 最近向投資人表示，截至 9 月底，1;32c公司的年化營收正接近 500 億美元，遠低於\n《金融時報》及其他媒體上月底根據提供給投資人的資訊所報導的 700 億美元。\n\n年化營收是衡量整體 AI 市場需求最重要的指標之一。OpenAI 及其競爭對手 Anthropic\n的這項數據，不僅支撐著科技業龐大的基礎設施投資，也影響著公開股票市場的成長預期\n。\n\n根據一名知情人士透露，這次數據出現落差，源於 OpenAI 的投資人試圖將其年化營收\n與 Anthropic 進行直接比較。\n\n問題在於，兩家公司的營收計算方式不同。\n\nAnthropic 會將透過 AWS、Google Cloud 等雲端合作夥伴銷售所產生的營收納入計算，\n而 OpenAI 則不會。\n\n先前，投資人為了讓兩家公司的數據具有可比性，曾嘗試將 OpenAI 的年化營收調整為包\n含更多銷售收入的「總額基礎」（Gross Up）。\n\n這項調整導致市場在 8 月出現 OpenAI 年化營收已達 400 億美元的報導。\n此後，OpenAI 又向投資人表示，公司營收已成長超過 70%，最終促成了市場流傳的 700\n億美元數字。\n\n心得/評論：\n\nOpenAI年化營收比先前對外透露的數字低了約200億美元\n消息一出 米股帶著夜盤一起崩\n鳩竟市場是不是高估了AI需求規模？\n讓我們繼續看下去", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "a0808996", "content": "自己編故事 在自己殺自己xd", "time": "10/09 01:02"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ArgoVesta", "content": "哈哈還有AI憨多在喊盤就知道該繼續殺CCCCCCCC", "time": "10/09 01:03"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "baka1412", "content": "https://i.imgur.com/wCxvIF3.jpeg", "time": "10/09 01:04"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "thg156yu789", "content": "下地獄吧多娃 還敢借錢買股票", "time": "10/09 01:04"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "UC93", "content": "仁勳會幫忙消除雜音的.....對吧?", "time": "10/09 01:05"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ziggs8308", "content": "市場全炸了", "time": "10/09 01:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "liaon98", "content": "AI is over", "time": "10/09 01:06"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "liaon98", "content": "國慶最大鬼故事", "time": "10/09 01:06"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "l11111111", "content": "所以只是計算方式不同？華西街最好不知道", "time": "10/09 01:07"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "jwiww", "content": "等一下就是從頭到尾OAI也沒講自己營收多少", "time": "10/09 01:07"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "jwiww", "content": "別人自己掰了一個營收然後現在說有少？", "time": "10/09 01:08"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "shunhahahaha", "content": "泡沫要來了", "time": "10/09 01:08"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "a6435966", "content": "Google gimini 不是營收就很好，有泡沫？", "time": "10/09 01:08"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "saladbread", "content": "數學太好", "time": "10/09 01:08"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "vic750314", "content": "差的那兩百億是媒體人與投資人用不同計算口徑推估", "time": "10/09 01:09"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "vic750314", "content": "的，他們自己用 Anthropic AWS等合作夥伴產生的銷", "time": "10/09 01:09"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "vic750314", "content": "售納入，但OpenAI沒有，就這樣~", "time": "10/09 01:09"}, {"tag": "推", "use